'''''Rubus hochstetterorum ''''' is a rare species of [[flowering plant]] in the [[rose family]]. It has been found only in the [[Azores Islands]] in the [[North Atlantic]], part of [[Portugal]].<ref>Seubert, Moritz August. 1844.  Flora Azorica 48</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Silvado-manso, Silva-mansa |url=https://siaram.azores.gov.pt/flora/flora-vascular/silvado-manso/1.html |access-date=2026-06-12 |website=SIARAM |language=pt}}</ref>

